    "workload": "Offline sklearn digits; 64-32-10 ReLU MLP; 8 clients in a ring; alpha=.3; batch size 32; LR=.05 fixed in advance; zero momentum/decay; one minibatch per update; uniform CIS; averaging_interval=1; 3 simulated seconds; local-model snapshots at 1,2,3 seconds; all 445 test examples; 3 seeds.",
